WEBVTT

00:00:15.180 --> 00:00:16.310
Su!

00:00:22.980 --> 00:00:25.080
Will the prince marry the washerwoman?

00:00:28.270 --> 00:00:30.410
Don't try to control Hae Soo
with this lie

00:00:30.410 --> 00:00:32.590
If I said I'm getting married, then I'm getting married

00:00:33.480 --> 00:00:34.780
You!

00:00:38.280 --> 00:00:48.280
Project coordinator, editor, typesetter and song translator: Nemie

00:00:48.380 --> 00:00:58.380
Translators: Nemie, tamaramin, Kaia

00:00:58.130 --> 00:01:00.140
Stop pretending you care about her

00:00:58.480 --> 00:01:08.480
Beta Editor: Sana

00:01:00.140 --> 00:01:02.250
and turn away from her as before

00:01:03.230 --> 00:01:05.430
You are no longer related to her

00:01:05.430 --> 00:01:07.260
She has nothing to do with you

00:01:36.880 --> 00:01:39.170
- Your Majesty!
- Your Majesty!

00:01:43.570 --> 00:01:45.480
- Your Majesty!
- Your Majesty!

00:01:45.480 --> 00:01:46.720
Your Majesty...

00:01:53.620 --> 00:01:55.390
Your Majesty!

00:01:55.840 --> 00:01:57.100
What should I do, brother?

00:01:57.100 --> 00:01:59.910
Find the 8th brother. Now!

00:02:08.670 --> 00:02:11.470
Go away quickly

00:02:21.780 --> 00:02:23.280
Take His Majesty to his chambers

00:02:23.280 --> 00:02:24.420
Yes

00:02:29.780 --> 00:02:31.780
Episode 13

00:02:43.140 --> 00:02:45.490
Is this how I'll leave?

00:02:46.680 --> 00:02:49.300
Where are you going to go?

00:02:49.300 --> 00:02:52.620
Please don't say such words, they don't suit you

00:02:53.500 --> 00:02:57.080
So short and fleeting

00:02:59.350 --> 00:03:02.860
What have I done in my time?

00:03:04.830 --> 00:03:07.420
You founded an empire, your majesty

00:03:10.150 --> 00:03:11.410
Empire?

00:03:16.260 --> 00:03:19.880
Will Goryeo live forever?

00:03:22.070 --> 00:03:26.020
Did I do the right thing by choosing Mu as crown prince?

00:03:27.620 --> 00:03:31.070
We can confirm that the decision was correct

00:03:31.780 --> 00:03:35.990
The Crown Prince will ascend to the throne

00:03:42.960 --> 00:03:46.500
I see I have very good friends

00:03:51.720 --> 00:03:54.270
Now my war is over

00:03:56.410 --> 00:03:59.250
And yours is just beginning

00:04:02.190 --> 00:04:03.860
I leave it to you

00:04:07.280 --> 00:04:10.110
Crown Prince and 4th Prince

00:04:14.220 --> 00:04:15.490
Your Majesty

00:04:33.770 --> 00:04:36.820
Let's get married

00:04:37.620 --> 00:04:38.810
What?

00:04:38.810 --> 00:04:41.420
It was hard to travel as an ambassador

00:04:41.420 --> 00:04:43.790
I often felt free

00:04:43.790 --> 00:04:46.390
Every minute I thought about you

00:04:47.560 --> 00:04:50.460
I wanted you to feel this freedom too

00:04:54.480 --> 00:04:56.130
Come with me

00:05:09.580 --> 00:05:12.380
The Crown Prince must not find out about this situation

00:05:13.120 --> 00:05:15.730
All exits from Songak are blocked

00:05:15.730 --> 00:05:17.650
When the emperor dies,

00:05:18.400 --> 00:05:21.000
we must carry out his last decree and win

00:05:25.510 --> 00:05:27.130
Brother, what's wrong with the emperor?

00:05:59.030 --> 00:06:00.630
What are you doing?!

00:06:00.630 --> 00:06:03.590
Your Highnesses, you must return

00:06:03.590 --> 00:06:06.230
His Majesty will give his orders soon

00:06:06.630 --> 00:06:08.130
We can't

00:06:08.130 --> 00:06:10.420
If the emperor suffers from illness,

00:06:10.420 --> 00:06:13.410
we must protect Jeongdeokjeong,
so that his last decree remains unchanged

00:06:14.710 --> 00:06:18.170
Would you like to change his latest decree?

00:06:20.030 --> 00:06:22.370
If you don't want to be suspected of this,

00:06:22.370 --> 00:06:24.010
better leave this place

00:06:26.190 --> 00:06:28.320
I don't see brother So

00:06:28.320 --> 00:06:29.590
What?

00:06:31.370 --> 00:06:35.930
Whoever steps into Jeongdeokjeong without the emperor's permission,

00:06:36.730 --> 00:06:39.550
will be killed for treason

00:06:40.380 --> 00:06:44.800
So everyone better leave now

00:07:11.120 --> 00:07:14.260
Out of the way! I must see the emperor

00:07:19.570 --> 00:07:22.540
Are you stopping me? Tired of living?

00:07:22.540 --> 00:07:23.790
Go your separate ways

00:07:28.680 --> 00:07:31.970
Chi Mon, are you hiding the emperor's fortune?

00:07:31.970 --> 00:07:33.760
I'm sorry

00:07:33.760 --> 00:07:37.200
What about princes? You didn't harm them, did you?

00:07:37.600 --> 00:07:38.910
No way

00:07:38.910 --> 00:07:41.910
The princes went to their homes

00:07:44.790 --> 00:07:48.090
You are stalling for time until the Crown Prince arrives

00:08:05.700 --> 00:08:06.870
Your Majesty

00:08:10.850 --> 00:08:14.930
Even the aroma of your tea is similar to the aroma of Soo Yeon's tea

00:08:15.510 --> 00:08:17.360
Are you feeling well?

00:08:17.360 --> 00:08:20.420
I'll die soon

00:08:23.630 --> 00:08:25.810
Bring the Crown Prince

00:08:26.800 --> 00:08:29.170
He must come before it's too late

00:08:29.750 --> 00:08:30.950
Me?

00:08:31.930 --> 00:08:34.130
I'll find someone who can do it faster

00:08:34.130 --> 00:08:37.570
No, do it yourself

00:08:39.410 --> 00:08:43.180
No one from the palace

00:08:44.340 --> 00:08:50.220
must not find out about my death before the arrival of the crown prince

00:08:51.200 --> 00:08:52.250
What?

00:08:54.220 --> 00:08:59.050
As soon as you leave my chambers, someone will speak to you

00:09:01.400 --> 00:09:04.050
Asks about my condition

00:09:05.570 --> 00:09:09.170
And to anyone who asks about this,

00:09:10.130 --> 00:09:13.510
tell me that I asked you to bring tea

00:09:16.810 --> 00:09:20.440
Anyone who asks if I'm dead, be careful

00:09:24.270 --> 00:09:29.180
This man wants to take the throne

00:09:36.590 --> 00:09:38.000
Go

00:09:38.900 --> 00:09:41.360
You can't trust anyone

00:09:42.300 --> 00:09:48.700
The fate of Goryeo rests on your shoulders

00:09:51.420 --> 00:09:55.190
That's probably the reason you're here

00:09:55.190 --> 00:09:57.530
- Be on your guard
- Yes, general!

00:10:14.130 --> 00:10:15.930
Step aside if you don't want to die

00:10:24.740 --> 00:10:27.350
No one will leave Songak

00:10:27.350 --> 00:10:30.520
I'm sure this is Uka's order

00:10:31.870 --> 00:10:33.810
My suspicions are correct

00:10:34.460 --> 00:10:38.050
Last night I saw Uka dressed in armor

00:10:38.720 --> 00:10:40.850
I saw her clearly under his clothes

00:10:42.790 --> 00:10:46.010
I was wondering why he was secretly wearing armor in the palace

00:10:48.720 --> 00:10:52.470
Was he planning to kill the emperor at the peace meeting?

00:11:03.760 --> 00:11:04.930
Su

00:11:20.010 --> 00:11:21.510
Where are you going in such a hurry?

00:11:25.800 --> 00:11:28.030
The Emperor asked for tea

00:11:28.980 --> 00:11:30.420
Heading to Damiwon

00:11:35.890 --> 00:11:37.910
What about getting married to So?

00:11:38.410 --> 00:11:40.460
I didn't know you were in such a relationship

00:11:40.460 --> 00:11:41.700
I was surprised

00:11:41.700 --> 00:11:43.550
You are mistaken, 4th Prince...

00:11:46.520 --> 00:11:49.960
In general, I must fulfill the emperor's instructions

00:11:51.160 --> 00:11:52.700
We'll talk when I get back

00:12:02.230 --> 00:12:03.380
- I...
- Perhaps...

00:12:04.560 --> 00:12:08.340
The Emperor... died?

00:12:12.970 --> 00:12:14.280
I'm worried about him

00:12:15.540 --> 00:12:18.960
The Emperor... died?

00:12:18.960 --> 00:12:22.560
Anyone who asks if I'm dead, be careful

00:12:26.170 --> 00:12:30.780
This man wants to take the throne

00:12:40.480 --> 00:12:42.140
Your Highness may

00:12:45.740 --> 00:12:46.810
do you want

00:12:49.010 --> 00:12:50.970
become an emperor?

00:12:50.970 --> 00:12:53.130
What happened last night doesn't matter

00:12:53.710 --> 00:12:55.790
In any case, the emperor is dead

00:12:55.790 --> 00:12:58.340
The question is who will take the throne

00:12:58.340 --> 00:13:00.070
The emperor's successor is Prince Mu

00:13:00.070 --> 00:13:01.720
It's his will

00:13:01.720 --> 00:13:03.390
What do you want, brother?

00:13:03.390 --> 00:13:06.900
Perhaps you want to become an emperor?

00:13:09.790 --> 00:13:11.200
Do you want

00:13:15.190 --> 00:13:16.550
become an emperor?

00:13:21.870 --> 00:13:26.820
Can you become an emperor if you just want to?

00:13:26.820 --> 00:13:29.040
You can become with my help

00:13:29.040 --> 00:13:33.190
If the Hwangbo clan and I support you,

00:13:33.190 --> 00:13:34.980
you will become him

00:13:38.060 --> 00:13:39.320
When I lost you

00:13:41.300 --> 00:13:43.700
I couldn't do anything with the power I had

00:13:46.430 --> 00:13:51.600
To protect those I love in this palace

00:13:51.600 --> 00:13:54.130
I realized that I must become more powerful

00:13:55.180 --> 00:13:58.900
What will the one who becomes emperor do?

00:13:58.900 --> 00:14:01.350
The world will be yours

00:14:02.230 --> 00:14:04.270
You can have it all

00:14:05.110 --> 00:14:09.180
So, will I also get a person’s heart?

00:14:11.420 --> 00:14:16.270
If I become an emperor, will the heart I want become mine?

00:14:16.270 --> 00:14:18.090
You asked if I wanted to become an emperor

00:14:20.290 --> 00:14:21.850
I'm going to become one

00:14:23.820 --> 00:14:25.030
If so,

00:14:26.670 --> 00:14:27.870
then I want

00:14:31.760 --> 00:14:36.240
I... will become emperor

00:14:49.160 --> 00:14:52.390
Your Majesty, how are you?

00:14:59.710 --> 00:15:00.870
Your Majesty

00:15:02.020 --> 00:15:03.830
Have you come to your senses?

00:15:29.990 --> 00:15:31.930
Soo Young...

00:15:50.520 --> 00:15:52.570
He died

00:15:59.530 --> 00:16:00.610
No

00:16:07.190 --> 00:16:08.670
How could you leave me?

00:16:10.640 --> 00:16:12.130
Open your eyes!

00:16:13.090 --> 00:16:14.360
Empress

00:16:17.750 --> 00:16:20.660
You can't leave me like this

00:16:20.660 --> 00:16:22.390
Come back!

00:16:23.220 --> 00:16:24.930
You can't leave!

00:16:25.660 --> 00:16:28.130
You can't leave me like that!

00:16:28.760 --> 00:16:31.180
Your Majesty, come back...

00:16:32.560 --> 00:16:34.600
Come back, open your eyes...

00:16:36.280 --> 00:16:39.260
Come back, come back!

00:16:40.500 --> 00:16:42.060
Wake up!

00:16:44.290 --> 00:16:45.990
Come back!

00:16:47.900 --> 00:16:49.660
Terrible man

00:16:50.770 --> 00:16:54.980
For your sake I will become emperor

00:16:56.400 --> 00:16:59.940
For me? Are you doing this because of me?

00:16:59.940 --> 00:17:01.480
It's already begun

00:17:01.990 --> 00:17:06.200
Tomorrow I will attack Jeongdeokjeong with 3rd brother

00:17:06.200 --> 00:17:07.910
No, you...

00:17:09.530 --> 00:17:10.910
This is high treason

00:17:12.550 --> 00:17:16.860
Su, the crown prince won't come back anyway

00:17:17.860 --> 00:17:20.240
This is a fight for the right to sit on a free throne

00:17:22.640 --> 00:17:26.550
Just don't tell anyone about this

00:17:27.320 --> 00:17:29.370
Just hide and wait for me

00:17:31.730 --> 00:17:33.060
You can do it, right?

00:17:37.430 --> 00:17:38.890
I'll ask you again

00:17:41.100 --> 00:17:45.530
The Emperor... has already passed away?

00:17:46.050 --> 00:17:47.390
Emperor...

00:17:50.090 --> 00:17:52.040
asked to bring tea

00:18:05.650 --> 00:18:09.770
The Crown Prince... is now in Chahyun

00:18:15.480 --> 00:18:17.740
You can't bring him

00:18:44.430 --> 00:18:47.590
Do you want to become an emperor?
to win someone's heart?

00:18:47.590 --> 00:18:49.680
The throne is no place for such jokes!

00:18:49.680 --> 00:18:51.330
For me this is the only reason

00:18:52.180 --> 00:18:53.370
Open up the road

00:18:53.940 --> 00:18:57.630
Otherwise I'll think
that you want to commit treason

00:18:57.630 --> 00:19:02.280
I only stop people with a purpose
prevent treason as the emperor is ill

00:19:03.190 --> 00:19:07.290
I can’t open the way for a person,
because I don’t know when he will return

00:19:07.830 --> 00:19:10.690
No exceptions, come back

00:19:21.120 --> 00:19:22.640
You ruined everything

00:19:22.920 --> 00:19:27.350
If it weren't for you, I would have killed the emperor

00:19:29.350 --> 00:19:32.970
Pretending to be a gisaeng to kill the emperor?

00:19:34.310 --> 00:19:36.370
You really are sinister

00:19:37.970 --> 00:19:39.440
Why do you need this?

00:19:39.440 --> 00:19:42.010
What kind of hostility are you experiencing?
did you ever do something like that?!

00:19:42.010 --> 00:19:43.250
Your father...

00:19:44.760 --> 00:19:46.510
killed my family

00:19:49.760 --> 00:19:50.960
Everyone

00:19:53.260 --> 00:19:54.920
I'm the only one left

00:19:57.520 --> 00:19:58.660
Killed everyone

00:20:08.320 --> 00:20:10.190
Is that why you have a scar on your wrist?

00:20:14.940 --> 00:20:16.550
Because of my father?

00:20:21.660 --> 00:20:22.800
I'm sorry

00:20:24.400 --> 00:20:25.920
I apologize on his behalf

00:20:27.840 --> 00:20:28.990
I'm sorry

00:20:45.750 --> 00:20:47.660
I'm sorry I'm his son

00:21:07.900 --> 00:21:12.160
In any case, the emperor is now either dead,

00:21:13.120 --> 00:21:15.020
or close to death

00:21:15.020 --> 00:21:18.740
So the crown prince will now take the throne?

00:21:20.870 --> 00:21:23.590
Oh yes. It's good that you're here

00:21:23.590 --> 00:21:26.700
Any news from Jeongdeokjeong?

00:21:26.700 --> 00:21:30.700
Perhaps the emperor... has already died?

00:21:30.700 --> 00:21:32.400
Don't talk so casually

00:21:32.400 --> 00:21:35.580
Now he should have even more strength,
because he drank tea from Damiwon

00:21:35.580 --> 00:21:36.790
Why are you saying that?

00:21:36.790 --> 00:21:37.920
Sure?

00:21:38.950 --> 00:21:42.280
Then why is he holding the mothers hostage?

00:21:42.280 --> 00:21:43.460
Hostage?

00:21:43.460 --> 00:21:45.760
They haven't returned from Jeongdeokjeong yet?

00:21:45.760 --> 00:21:50.310
Probably keeping them there to keep the news from leaking out.

00:21:51.920 --> 00:21:53.450
I'll go back there

00:21:53.450 --> 00:21:56.900
By the way, you. Where did you find out about Damiwon?

00:21:57.740 --> 00:21:59.770
Who said they brought him tea?

00:22:00.680 --> 00:22:05.050
They say that to the emperor
I got my appetite back thanks to Hae Soo's tea

00:22:05.560 --> 00:22:08.960
She brewed it last night and today

00:22:10.800 --> 00:22:12.470
Find this girl

00:22:13.310 --> 00:22:16.170
Only she knows about the emperor's condition...

00:22:17.200 --> 00:22:20.280
She must not be allowed to tell the Crown Prince about the Emperor.

00:22:20.280 --> 00:22:22.630
Find it now!

00:22:47.810 --> 00:22:48.940
Have you seen Hae Soo?

00:22:48.940 --> 00:22:50.250
I don't know her

00:22:50.250 --> 00:22:54.070
Well, the washerwoman from the gisaeng house

00:22:56.210 --> 00:22:57.250
Why don't you know?

00:22:57.730 --> 00:22:59.280
Why don't you know?!

00:23:01.880 --> 00:23:04.010
The Emperor died

00:23:07.180 --> 00:23:08.260
What?

00:23:09.060 --> 00:23:12.310
When was the last time I saw him?
he talked about how he would die soon

00:23:13.760 --> 00:23:15.000
And now...

00:23:18.530 --> 00:23:21.420
He asked to bring the crown prince secretly

00:23:25.780 --> 00:23:29.190
The 3rd Prince will attack Jeongdeokjeong tomorrow

00:23:30.290 --> 00:23:32.240
You must bring the crown prince and stop him

00:23:32.940 --> 00:23:34.550
How did you know this?

00:23:37.560 --> 00:23:39.780
Is this important now?

00:23:43.550 --> 00:23:45.690
Crown Prince in Hubaekje

00:23:46.710 --> 00:23:48.960
All exits from Songak are blocked

00:23:50.090 --> 00:23:52.230
We need to find another way out

00:23:52.880 --> 00:23:54.230
Hupakje you say?

00:23:56.530 --> 00:23:58.540
There's a man who might know another way

00:24:04.040 --> 00:24:07.120
The Emperor lost consciousness, so there are no people left who recognize you

00:24:08.270 --> 00:24:12.760
Would it be right to ask you to forget everything and be with me?

00:24:15.740 --> 00:24:16.960
Woo Hee!

00:24:19.510 --> 00:24:23.100
Woo Hee, did you say that you are from Hubaekje?

00:24:25.440 --> 00:24:26.800
Why are you suddenly asking?

00:24:26.800 --> 00:24:28.770
We must bring the crown prince

00:24:28.770 --> 00:24:30.870
- What?
- How can I trust her?

00:24:32.200 --> 00:24:35.420
She's my friend, you can trust her

00:24:36.080 --> 00:24:39.960
I don't know what we're talking about
but yes, you can trust

00:24:43.090 --> 00:24:46.580
Looks like the Emperor has passed away

00:24:46.580 --> 00:24:47.650
What?

00:24:55.940 --> 00:24:57.350
Are you sure?

00:25:00.170 --> 00:25:01.700
It's quite possible

00:25:03.210 --> 00:25:07.340
Soon Yo and Wook

00:25:09.460 --> 00:25:11.740
will attack Jeongdeokjeong for the throne

00:25:15.230 --> 00:25:18.250
I'll stop them, and you find the crown prince

00:25:19.270 --> 00:25:20.610
This will take two days...

00:25:21.750 --> 00:25:23.820
Uk blocked all exits

00:25:26.840 --> 00:25:31.490
There is a road from Songak that only I know

00:25:37.470 --> 00:25:42.810
If Seo tried to leave Songak,
it means he wanted to bring the crown prince

00:25:42.810 --> 00:25:46.370
You don't think the emperor is already dead, do you?

00:25:46.370 --> 00:25:47.620
I don't know yet

00:25:48.230 --> 00:25:51.250
I haven't heard anything from my mother,
she is now in Jeongdeokjeong

00:25:51.250 --> 00:25:54.380
So no one knows about the emperor's condition

00:25:55.010 --> 00:25:56.770
This is an opportunity

00:25:56.770 --> 00:25:59.640
Attack Jeongdeokjeong and take out the mother

00:25:59.900 --> 00:26:03.270
Announce that the Emperor has chosen you as his successor

00:26:03.270 --> 00:26:04.940
No one can refute

00:26:05.610 --> 00:26:07.280
No fear at all

00:26:07.280 --> 00:26:09.190
Do you want to change the emperor's last decree?

00:26:09.190 --> 00:26:10.780
We must not hesitate, otherwise we will lose everything!

00:26:10.780 --> 00:26:11.940
I already said

00:26:12.550 --> 00:26:16.030
I don't want to be a traitor emperor

00:26:17.040 --> 00:26:18.980
I don't want anyone to play around with my weaknesses

00:26:19.670 --> 00:26:21.630
I don't want to have flaws

00:26:23.040 --> 00:26:26.050
I don't know your true intentions

00:26:27.590 --> 00:26:30.900
Yesterday you wore armor in the palace

00:26:30.900 --> 00:26:33.640
I thought that you were on Yo's side,

00:26:33.640 --> 00:26:35.280
but you don't want to kill the crown prince

00:26:36.130 --> 00:26:37.760
I'm confused

00:26:37.760 --> 00:26:39.700
I prioritize

00:26:41.240 --> 00:26:43.370
Who is more profitable to attack first?

00:26:44.460 --> 00:26:47.960
Crown Prince or 3rd brother?

00:26:49.680 --> 00:26:50.870
Or...

00:26:58.210 --> 00:27:02.350
I can't make a single mistake on my road to the throne

00:27:04.220 --> 00:27:06.340
You've changed, brother

00:27:07.610 --> 00:27:09.940
You are not being forced into this.

00:27:09.940 --> 00:27:12.970
It seems that now you really want to take the throne

00:27:14.290 --> 00:27:15.560
I'm happy

00:27:18.950 --> 00:27:21.490
If the situation does not change,
I have to change

00:27:22.420 --> 00:27:26.120
The thing that worries me the most right now...

00:27:27.770 --> 00:27:29.370
one man's betrayal

00:27:45.220 --> 00:27:48.140
What's the matter? Do you want to sit down?

00:27:49.220 --> 00:27:50.420
No

00:27:51.600 --> 00:27:52.990
I don't like it

00:27:56.240 --> 00:27:58.340
Everyone risks their life for this place

00:27:59.570 --> 00:28:00.740
Don't you like it?

00:28:01.670 --> 00:28:06.500
The Emperor refused his concubine Oh,
to protect this place

00:28:07.780 --> 00:28:09.150
And to you, Your Highness...

00:28:14.230 --> 00:28:16.380
will have to fight with your brothers

00:28:18.970 --> 00:28:20.710
This is a scary place

00:28:27.610 --> 00:28:29.300
Even if you have to fight tomorrow

00:28:32.350 --> 00:28:34.510
You won't hurt them, will you?

00:28:36.290 --> 00:28:37.790
Are you worried about Uka?

00:28:40.200 --> 00:28:41.920
It seems you still consider him a relative

00:28:45.100 --> 00:28:46.800
Then why did you come to me?

00:28:47.820 --> 00:28:49.570
I could just watch and not interfere

00:28:52.490 --> 00:28:54.420
He said it was for me

00:28:57.870 --> 00:29:02.790
He was angry that he couldn't do anything when I was kicked out.

00:29:04.720 --> 00:29:07.500
He couldn't do anything, so he had to leave me alone

00:29:09.680 --> 00:29:12.140
He said he wants more power

00:29:14.490 --> 00:29:15.600
I see

00:29:17.210 --> 00:29:18.830
I felt the same then

00:29:22.320 --> 00:29:27.190
The Emperor told me to live my life
reasonably and according to reason

00:29:30.630 --> 00:29:32.910
That's why I side with the crown prince

00:29:35.830 --> 00:29:39.070
But if the 8th prince is injured...

00:29:40.730 --> 00:29:45.960
My conscience will always torment me

00:29:48.500 --> 00:29:49.680
I understand

00:29:50.810 --> 00:29:54.000
And although I can't promise, I'll try

00:29:56.930 --> 00:29:58.930
Because I don’t want Uk to die either

00:30:01.770 --> 00:30:03.700
I might die too

00:30:04.550 --> 00:30:05.980
Aren't you worried about me?

00:30:06.230 --> 00:30:08.600
You are Gwangjong

00:30:09.580 --> 00:30:11.430
There's still more of the story ahead

00:30:12.030 --> 00:30:16.880
People, looking at whom it seems as if they will never die, one day still die

00:30:23.330 --> 00:30:25.100
You'll be fine, Your Highness

00:30:27.850 --> 00:30:29.480
I can't talk about others

00:30:31.150 --> 00:30:32.300
but I'm sure of this

00:31:07.540 --> 00:31:08.690
Go away

00:31:09.710 --> 00:31:12.940
This is my man, don't touch him

00:31:14.460 --> 00:31:17.600
His Majesty would not like your behavior

00:31:17.600 --> 00:31:18.790
What do you know?

00:31:19.480 --> 00:31:23.840
Has he ever loved you?

00:31:26.740 --> 00:31:27.990
Take your hand away!

00:31:33.270 --> 00:31:36.350
Please don't let your emotions get the better of you and don't make a scene

00:31:39.160 --> 00:31:40.270
Your Majesty

00:31:53.320 --> 00:31:58.060
I'd like... to see the Emperor

00:32:01.460 --> 00:32:04.340
How did you get here?

00:32:05.240 --> 00:32:08.490
What about Yo? Is Jeong here?

00:32:40.470 --> 00:32:42.250
His Majesty's last words:

00:32:42.760 --> 00:32:44.110
human life is short

00:32:45.320 --> 00:32:49.020
His Majesty said that his life was short and fleeting

00:32:50.570 --> 00:32:52.270
Gone and disappeared

00:33:11.730 --> 00:33:13.470
Two years earlier (Shinzhu)

00:33:13.630 --> 00:33:18.230
The emperor probably thought that sending a mask every year was enough for his father

00:34:27.170 --> 00:34:28.200
Chi Mon

00:34:32.400 --> 00:34:34.910
How many people and weapons are there in Jeongdeokjeong?

00:34:37.280 --> 00:34:39.200
Go check it out with General Pak

00:34:40.360 --> 00:34:41.740
When the sun comes up...

00:34:42.980 --> 00:34:47.500
The 3rd and 8th princes will stage a rebellion

00:34:50.380 --> 00:34:53.330
The Emperor wished to transfer the throne to the Crown Prince

00:34:55.500 --> 00:34:57.460
We have to help this happen

00:34:57.460 --> 00:34:59.540
I'll talk to General Park

00:35:02.010 --> 00:35:05.140
Did you just call Uka?

00:35:05.140 --> 00:35:06.810
I guess I heard wrong

00:35:09.170 --> 00:35:10.530
My apologies

00:35:12.130 --> 00:35:14.890
Rebellion? What about Yo?

00:35:15.650 --> 00:35:18.540
Yes. He'll probably come for me

00:35:18.540 --> 00:35:22.140
He'll come to see
why did you lock me here

00:35:26.400 --> 00:35:27.870
Don't you dare touch Yo

00:35:28.420 --> 00:35:31.630
If even one hair falls from his head, I will personally kill you.

00:35:33.760 --> 00:35:36.320
Do you think that after committing treason he will survive?

00:35:37.790 --> 00:35:39.970
You are too greedy

00:35:49.900 --> 00:35:51.330
Leave my son alone!

00:35:52.180 --> 00:35:54.780
Treason? What treason?

00:35:58.890 --> 00:36:01.650
Shut your mouth, don't be such a fool

00:36:01.650 --> 00:36:04.160
One wrong move and our sons will die

00:36:04.160 --> 00:36:06.500
We need to figure out how to save our children.

00:36:07.080 --> 00:36:10.820
Forget that you are a woman and remember that you are a mother

00:36:10.820 --> 00:36:12.040
Do you understand?

00:36:30.520 --> 00:36:31.720
We need to continue on our way

00:36:32.390 --> 00:36:35.040
We need to rest, this will allow us to arrive early

00:36:35.040 --> 00:36:37.590
If we keep driving, your wound will open up more.

00:36:38.650 --> 00:36:40.510
We may not get there at all

00:36:53.370 --> 00:36:57.550
From the very beginning I didn't want to hide the fact that I'm a prince

00:36:58.620 --> 00:37:01.210
I wasn't trying to deceive you

00:37:02.140 --> 00:37:03.230
I know

00:37:05.510 --> 00:37:06.950
You're not like that

00:37:12.580 --> 00:37:14.160
I hid a lot from you

00:37:17.100 --> 00:37:18.660
We're even

00:37:24.360 --> 00:37:27.660
I could be an ordinary musician and you are a gisaeng

00:37:24.650 --> 00:37:31.100
Because I'm next to you, I'm very happy

00:37:30.780 --> 00:37:33.030
Curious what that would be like?

00:37:32.120 --> 00:37:38.720
Because I'm next to you, I keep dreaming

00:37:35.340 --> 00:37:36.660
If so...

00:37:39.700 --> 00:37:47.340
Because I'm next to you, I smile so brightly

00:37:40.790 --> 00:37:43.270
what kind of relationship would we have?

00:37:46.720 --> 00:37:48.830
Rest a little longer

00:37:47.340 --> 00:37:53.220
For you to be mine, I always pray to the Gods

00:37:49.990 --> 00:37:52.070
We only have one mountain to cross

00:37:54.880 --> 00:38:01.620
If you see my love and my feelings

00:37:54.960 --> 00:38:00.110
Then we will be in Hubaekje

00:38:01.730 --> 00:38:03.250
My homeland

00:38:02.650 --> 00:38:09.520
If you find my love and the path to me

00:38:03.900 --> 00:38:07.840
Tomorrow our paths will diverge

00:38:09.520 --> 00:38:11.830
There will be no more reasons for us to see each other

00:38:10.160 --> 00:38:18.700
I will give my heart completely

00:38:13.550 --> 00:38:14.900
I don't want

00:38:17.520 --> 00:38:18.620
Okay

00:38:18.700 --> 00:38:29.600
If you can stay with me for the rest of your life

00:38:21.670 --> 00:38:23.000
I understand how you feel

00:38:30.060 --> 00:38:33.970
Since we won't see each other again, then...

00:38:36.470 --> 00:38:40.670
can I do whatever I want tonight?

00:38:39.780 --> 00:38:46.420
I want to love you like my last love

00:38:47.310 --> 00:38:54.300
If only everything were like this, then life would be happy

00:38:54.830 --> 00:39:03.380
I will give my heart completely

00:39:03.380 --> 00:39:13.080
If you can stay with me for the rest of your life

00:39:22.480 --> 00:39:24.670
It's suspiciously quiet here

00:39:24.670 --> 00:39:27.980
It's like they're waiting for us

00:39:27.980 --> 00:39:30.320
Most of the army is now with the crown prince

00:39:30.320 --> 00:39:32.300
There aren't many warriors left here

00:39:33.360 --> 00:39:37.110
Even if they want to come back now,
the journey back will take them a whole day

00:39:37.910 --> 00:39:39.590
I want to ask you for a favor

00:39:41.840 --> 00:39:43.650
Which one? You can ask for anything

00:39:43.650 --> 00:39:48.230
If 4th Prince So tries to stop us,

00:39:51.360 --> 00:39:53.280
please kill him

00:39:53.690 --> 00:39:55.950
You don't have to ask me for this

00:39:55.950 --> 00:40:00.160
I'll personally make sure I kill him

00:40:32.520 --> 00:40:35.660
You dare to bring an army
to the palace where the emperor lives?

00:40:35.660 --> 00:40:37.670
This is treason!

00:40:37.670 --> 00:40:40.560
My mother is here all day

00:40:40.560 --> 00:40:44.000
I must know the truth
why was Jeongdeokjeong under guard?

00:40:44.000 --> 00:40:47.630
I said that the emperor needs rest

00:40:47.630 --> 00:40:51.310
Do you think I will believe such an obvious lie?

00:40:52.280 --> 00:40:54.450
Let my mother go out

00:40:55.240 --> 00:40:57.220
or I'll assume that you're trying to oust the crown prince

00:40:57.220 --> 00:40:59.770
and plan to take the throne

00:42:24.180 --> 00:42:25.530
Crown Prince!

00:42:35.110 --> 00:42:37.640
Wook, go to Jeongdeokjeong...

00:42:49.220 --> 00:42:52.430
Are you going to betray me?

00:42:52.430 --> 00:42:56.420
We've never been on the same side, so it's not a betrayal

00:42:56.980 --> 00:43:00.190
I heard about your plans from Uka

00:43:00.190 --> 00:43:02.170
I received the letter and immediately went back

00:43:03.730 --> 00:43:06.490
Uk, this time you proved your loyalty

00:43:06.490 --> 00:43:07.980
It is an honor for me, Crown Prince

00:43:13.410 --> 00:43:17.870
So was it a trap to catch me?

00:43:43.090 --> 00:43:44.870
His Majesty...

00:43:46.840 --> 00:43:48.770
just slept

00:43:51.810 --> 00:43:55.610
He left a decree stating that Crown Prince Mu will become the next emperor

00:43:56.930 --> 00:44:02.010
The Empress and other wives
read and accepted the decree

00:44:02.880 --> 00:44:05.220
I brought this news to you, your highnesses!

00:44:06.950 --> 00:44:08.120
Father

00:44:11.550 --> 00:44:13.710
Congratulations to the new emperor!

00:44:13.710 --> 00:44:16.820
Long life to the emperor!
Long life to the emperor!

00:44:20.650 --> 00:44:22.470
Congratulations to the new emperor!

00:44:22.470 --> 00:44:25.440
Long life to the emperor!
Long life to the emperor!

00:44:25.440 --> 00:44:27.100
What are you all doing?!

00:44:27.510 --> 00:44:30.800
Welcome the new emperor!

00:44:31.120 --> 00:44:34.370
Long life to the emperor!
Long life to the emperor!

00:45:30.670 --> 00:45:32.440
Is he really dead?

00:45:37.440 --> 00:45:39.190
I can't believe it

00:45:43.470 --> 00:45:44.560
Your Majesty

00:45:50.690 --> 00:45:51.890
Father

00:45:54.990 --> 00:45:56.190
Father

00:46:00.850 --> 00:46:02.520
You'll see, Emperor

00:46:03.690 --> 00:46:07.110
You always thought I was too ambitious

00:46:07.110 --> 00:46:12.140
I, Yong Hwa, will make this empire mine

00:46:21.830 --> 00:46:23.220
Are you crazy?

00:46:23.220 --> 00:46:25.660
We must go say goodbye to the emperor

00:46:25.660 --> 00:46:27.670
You can't go to the palace

00:46:27.670 --> 00:46:31.050
You are very sick right now

00:46:31.050 --> 00:46:34.090
What are you talking about? I'm not sick

00:46:34.090 --> 00:46:36.440
You are so ill that you cannot attend the funeral

00:46:36.440 --> 00:46:38.700
You will not be able to attend the enthronement ceremony for the new emperor.

00:46:38.700 --> 00:46:41.900
This is the only way... This is the only way you can live

00:46:45.280 --> 00:46:48.650
Why can I die?
Explain clearly!

00:46:48.650 --> 00:46:51.940
Do you know what the new emperor will do as soon as he takes the throne?

00:46:53.590 --> 00:46:57.380
He will kill all brothers and nephews who can lay claim to the throne

00:47:06.870 --> 00:47:07.920
Will he kill?

00:47:07.920 --> 00:47:10.580
If you want to live you must live as quietly as a mouse

00:47:10.940 --> 00:47:13.860
We need the new emperor to forget about us

00:47:17.420 --> 00:47:20.640
Why are you giving me your armor?

00:47:20.640 --> 00:47:23.930
Do you want me to put on my wife's armor to save my life?

00:47:23.930 --> 00:47:26.850
I noticed that you look down on your husband

00:47:27.470 --> 00:47:31.460
Then... should we die together?

00:47:31.460 --> 00:47:34.230
Are you crazy? Why would I die with you?

00:47:39.200 --> 00:47:41.780
Why should I even die?

00:47:43.660 --> 00:47:47.640
Let's live... together

00:47:48.440 --> 00:47:51.580
Life or death is a matter of luck.
I'd rather both of us not die

00:47:51.610 --> 00:47:54.970
We're married, so we won't die alone

00:47:56.780 --> 00:47:58.430
Your Highness!

00:48:07.130 --> 00:48:09.200
You were on the side of the crown prince

00:48:10.840 --> 00:48:12.910
Why did they deceive me in this way?

00:48:18.030 --> 00:48:19.620
You did this on purpose, right?

00:48:20.740 --> 00:48:22.330
you were testing me

00:48:22.330 --> 00:48:26.380
In the end... you became a real Su

00:48:28.740 --> 00:48:33.680
You didn't plan to kill the 4th prince, did you?

00:48:39.260 --> 00:48:41.580
It wasn't a lie that I planned to become emperor

00:48:42.640 --> 00:48:45.890
Getting rid of those who might get in your way later is not a bad thing.

00:48:48.100 --> 00:48:49.330
I...

00:48:50.890 --> 00:48:53.350
I was the reason what happened to Concubine O

00:48:53.350 --> 00:48:55.250
Did you know how much pain I went through because of this?

00:48:56.790 --> 00:48:59.530
And yet you used me to kill the 4th prince?

00:49:03.950 --> 00:49:05.410
You have changed

00:49:07.150 --> 00:49:08.960
You are no longer the person I knew

00:49:08.960 --> 00:49:12.510
What about you? Why did you hide the truth from me?

00:49:12.890 --> 00:49:15.590
I would like you to inform me of the death of the emperor

00:49:17.040 --> 00:49:21.760
Did you care whether I died or not?

00:49:22.610 --> 00:49:26.350
The Emperor asked me to help the Crown Prince become his successor

00:49:26.350 --> 00:49:27.620
That's what was important

00:49:28.500 --> 00:49:31.100
I couldn't go against it

00:49:33.550 --> 00:49:39.660
And the 4th prince promised that he would not kill you

00:49:42.410 --> 00:49:46.910
Did you ask So for my life?

00:49:51.410 --> 00:49:52.970
You told me before

00:49:55.250 --> 00:49:57.800
That we should leave Songak and live peacefully

00:50:01.640 --> 00:50:03.450
I can do it now

00:50:04.090 --> 00:50:06.620
If you ask the emperor, he will allow it

00:50:06.620 --> 00:50:10.800
Even if we do this, new problems will arise

00:50:11.720 --> 00:50:12.980
There is no other way

00:50:18.040 --> 00:50:20.320
When I see you I

00:50:21.520 --> 00:50:24.310
You said you'd do this for me

00:50:21.820 --> 00:50:25.130
I can’t breathe, I’m timid

00:50:25.320 --> 00:50:28.920
It's as if everything in the world has stopped

00:50:27.510 --> 00:50:29.530
You even deceived yourself

00:50:31.220 --> 00:50:35.820
If I pass by like a breeze,

00:50:35.820 --> 00:50:38.920
you won't even notice

00:50:37.330 --> 00:50:38.480
Now...

00:50:39.620 --> 00:50:44.220
My heart is all given to you

00:50:41.170 --> 00:50:44.530
I no longer have the same feelings for you that I had before.

00:50:46.120 --> 00:50:52.220
But loving you is very painful for me

00:50:47.210 --> 00:50:48.700
I want to stay away from you

00:50:52.220 --> 00:50:54.420
And so sad

00:50:52.570 --> 00:50:54.490
Is it because of the 4th prince?

00:50:54.420 --> 00:50:58.920
I need to cross you out of my heart

00:50:56.950 --> 00:50:58.490
At least once

00:51:00.220 --> 00:51:01.820
so hard

00:51:00.580 --> 00:51:03.410
were you sure of my feelings for you?

00:51:04.020 --> 00:51:08.120
Don't forget, please!

00:51:05.500 --> 00:51:09.770
Did you trust me completely?

00:51:08.990 --> 00:51:13.420
That eternal love of mine

00:51:15.520 --> 00:51:21.620
But loving you is very painful for me

00:51:15.670 --> 00:51:17.710
I'll make sure you come back to me

00:51:21.330 --> 00:51:23.010
It won't be easy

00:51:21.620 --> 00:51:23.820
And so sad

00:51:23.820 --> 00:51:28.920
I need to cross you out of my heart

00:51:29.620 --> 00:51:31.220
so hard

00:51:33.420 --> 00:51:37.520
Don't forget, please!

00:51:38.390 --> 00:51:42.820
That eternal love of mine

00:52:55.130 --> 00:52:57.060
Don't kill him like he's an animal

00:53:09.480 --> 00:53:11.540
I'll do it. I can convince him

00:53:11.540 --> 00:53:12.600
Don't do this

00:53:13.630 --> 00:53:15.530
Can you hold him back until the end?

00:53:16.100 --> 00:53:17.550
He's still your big brother

00:53:44.800 --> 00:53:46.150
It's time for you to give up

00:53:46.650 --> 00:53:49.550
If it were you, would you give up?

00:54:55.550 --> 00:54:56.680
Brother!

00:55:04.600 --> 00:55:07.540
Brother! Brother!

00:55:57.360 --> 00:55:58.770
It's impossible

00:56:01.270 --> 00:56:02.730
It can't be

00:56:04.310 --> 00:56:05.770
This is impossible!

00:56:07.330 --> 00:56:08.470
Why Yo?

00:56:12.910 --> 00:56:14.990
This couldn't happen to me

00:56:16.210 --> 00:56:17.500
I'll find him

00:56:17.500 --> 00:56:19.050
I can find him!

00:56:19.940 --> 00:56:24.040
Yo... He always comes when I call, Jeong

00:56:24.040 --> 00:56:25.330
Mother

00:56:29.890 --> 00:56:31.960
I told him to stay away from Yo

00:56:33.330 --> 00:56:36.290
He took my child!

00:56:38.810 --> 00:56:40.200
Jeong

00:56:40.810 --> 00:56:44.570
Jeong, this couldn't happen to me.

00:56:44.570 --> 00:56:46.750
Jeong, Jeong!

00:56:46.750 --> 00:56:50.110
I'm here, I'll stay with you

00:56:50.110 --> 00:56:52.020
I won't leave you mom

00:56:52.520 --> 00:56:53.930
Yo!

00:56:54.820 --> 00:56:58.330
Son! My son!

00:56:58.330 --> 00:56:59.680
Yo!

00:57:43.470 --> 00:57:44.910
What's happened?

00:57:44.910 --> 00:57:49.260
I came to you, although I don’t think you will forgive me

00:57:50.820 --> 00:57:52.560
But I think you will understand me

00:58:00.890 --> 00:58:01.950
I...

00:58:05.220 --> 00:58:06.940
stabbed his older brother

00:58:23.590 --> 00:58:26.970
I will become the darkness

00:58:27.230 --> 00:58:30.770
And I'll wrap you in myself

00:58:30.890 --> 00:58:34.520
Just for a day, just like that

00:58:35.020 --> 00:58:38.490
Stay with me

00:58:38.990 --> 00:58:42.220
And I will become the moon

00:58:42.570 --> 00:58:46.120
I will be the light for one

00:58:46.970 --> 00:58:52.390
Wherever I am, wherever I go, I will come

00:58:53.690 --> 00:58:57.640
You are my love, believe me

00:58:58.020 --> 00:59:01.920
You're the only one I need so much

00:59:01.920 --> 00:59:05.640
I look at you from afar

00:59:05.890 --> 00:59:09.090
And I'll turn away again

00:59:09.190 --> 00:59:13.820
Here I confess to you alone

00:59:13.820 --> 00:59:17.720
With all my strength I

00:59:17.720 --> 00:59:20.940
Love, love, love

00:59:21.000 --> 00:59:26.960
Can you hear my heart now? Now

00:59:27.260 --> 00:59:31.610
When you're sad, when you're in trouble

00:59:31.610 --> 00:59:41.600
Only I am always with you, so that you smile

00:59:34.430 --> 00:59:41.410
Thanks for watching with us!
