Scarlet Hearts: Ryeo

00:59:42.280 --> 00:59:44.140
Do you still remember?

00:59:44.520 --> 00:59:46.140
Now

00:59:44.750 --> 00:59:49.550
Are you trying to make me give up?
Or do you want him to endlessly look only at you?

00:59:46.490 --> 00:59:50.580
From that first meeting, from that day

00:59:49.550 --> 00:59:52.380
If you don't come over to my side, then don't give me hope

00:59:50.580 --> 00:59:57.840
My heart was beating like that, I met you

00:59:52.380 --> 00:59:55.180
You forgot about important words... what are these words?

00:59:55.180 --> 00:59:57.180
I... love you

00:59:57.870 --> 01:00:02.390
Here I confess to you alone

00:59:59.280 --> 01:00:02.350
You must stop and hand me the throne

01:00:02.390 --> 01:00:07.490
With all my strength!

01:00:02.480 --> 01:00:05.900
The only way to protect mom and our family is to become a traitor!

01:00:06.130 --> 01:00:07.030
Is this for Hae Soo?

01:00:07.780 --> 01:00:10.180
Insurrection? Rebellion you say?

01:00:08.020 --> 01:00:11.430
Love, love, love

01:00:10.380 --> 01:00:12.880
Successful cheating is not cheating

01:00:11.430 --> 01:00:14.520
Can you hear my heart?

01:00:13.030 --> 01:00:15.030
Find the Emperor, now!

01:00:16.300 --> 01:00:17.640
Now

01:00:16.300 --> 01:00:17.130
You!
